    en: "PG Unit 1: Hello and My Class helps children begin to participate in classroom life after the initial settling-in period. The unit focuses on teacher-child interaction, peer awareness, classroom objects, classroom spaces, and simple response routines.\n\nThis unit is not mainly a greeting-vocabulary unit. It is a participation unit. Children are supported to look, listen, come closer, sit with the group, respond to teacher gestures, touch or show classroom objects, notice classmates, join simple transitions, and begin to take part in clean-up and group routines.\n\nFor PG children, English is used as a natural classroom medium. The purpose is not to require verbal output, but to help children connect repeated teacher talk with safe classroom actions and shared routines.",
